  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br>Welcome to \"Circle Sea\" our stunning 6500 SqFt 4-story beach view retreat, nestled in the picturesque coastal town of Inlet Beach, Florida. Walk out of your front door and hit the gorgeous boardwalk right to the beach or head 1 mile down the road to nearby Rosemary Beach and enjoy all the shops and fine dining beautiful Rosemary has to offer! This 6-bedroom, 10-bathroom house with amazing views, a beautiful private pool and gorgeous beach boardwalk is a haven of luxury and relaxation!<br><br>The Space:<br>As you step inside, you'll be captivated by the spaciousness and elegance of this exquisite property. With its contemporary design and high-end finishes, every corner of this home exudes modern coastal charm. The ample windows throughout the house frame breathtaking views of the beach and ocean, allowing natural light to flood the interiors and create a serene atmosphere.<br><br>Spread across four levels, this house provides abundant space for your group to unwind and find their own slice of paradise. The well-appointed bedrooms offer plush beds, ensuring a restful night's sleep for everyone. Each bedroom boasts its own private bathroom, featuring sleek fixtures and luxurious amenities, providing a haven of relaxation and privacy.<br><br>The main living area on the second floor is a perfect gathering spot for your entire group. The open-concept layout seamlessly connects the living room, dining area, and gourmet kitchen, creating a spacious and inviting atmosphere. The chef-inspired kitchen is fully equipped with top-of-the-line appliances, making it a joy to prepare meals together. The dining area offers ample seating for everyone to savor delicious meals while enjoying the company and breathtaking views.<br><br>One of the highlights of this magnificent property is the private pool area. Step outside onto the expansive deck and you'll find a shimmering pool that beckons you to take a refreshing dip. For an additional charge, you can indulge in the comfort of the heated pool. The private pool Lounge on the comfortable sun beds, soak up the warm Florida sun, and relish in the idyllic coastal ambiance. A beautifully landscaped backyard provides the ideal setting for outdoor gatherings, from savoring alfresco meals to toasting marshmallows around the fire pit under the starry night sky.<br><br>The real showstopper, however, lies just steps away. Follow the beautifully designed boardwalk, surrounded by lush vegetation, and be enchanted as it leads you directly to the pristine beach. Feel the soft sand beneath your toes and let the ocean breeze invigorate your senses. Spend your days building sandcastles, sunbathing, or taking refreshing dips in the crystal-clear waters of the Gulf of Mexico. The beach is your personal playground, inviting you to create memories that will last a lifetime.<br><br>Located in the coveted neighborhood of Inlet Beach, right next to the charming Rosemary Beach on the iconic county road 30A, this property offers the best of both worlds. Explore the vibrant local scene, filled with eclectic shops, trendy restaurants, and art galleries. Immerse yourself in the relaxed coastal lifestyle, where you can enjoy outdoor activities like paddle boarding, kayaking, or cycling along scenic trails.<br><br>Indulge in the ultimate beach getaway at our magnificent 4-story house in Inlet Beach, Florida. With its perfect blend of luxury, comfort, and breathtaking natural beauty, this is a vacation rental that promises an unforgettable experience for you and your loved ones. Book now and make memories that will be cherished forever.<br><br><br>Amenities Include: <br>- Smart TV's in every room - with apps for network channels, Netflix, Hulu, YouTubeTV, etc.<br>- 6 Bikes<br>- Parking in the driveway<br>- Full size washer and dryer<br>- Private Pool<br> - Heated (additional charge)<br>- Complimentary Wi-Fi<br>- Private deck<br>- Private Pool<br><br>Enhance Your Stay with This Exclusive Upgrade! <br>Make the most of your vacation with this premium add-on, designed for ultimate comfort and convenience! And don’t worry—no need to decide now! We will send you a text a few days before check-in if you'd like to add them.<br><br> Private Heated Pool – $50/night<br>Take a dip in your private pool, perfect for any season!<br>-Must be booked for the full stay (no partial payments)<br>-Temperature is pre-set for optimal comfort<br><br><br>Book Your Stay: <br>Unlock a memorable and stress-free vacation by reserving your spot at our enchanting property. Experience the allure of Circle Sea, a 6 -bedroom haven located on Highway 30A. With 10 bathrooms. Comfortably accommodating up to 18 guests, it's the perfect setting for your getaway. Feel free to reach out with any questions or special requests. <br><br>Your escape to 30A awaits - secure your dates today!<br><br><br>ADDITIONAL REQUIREMENTS:<br>- Must be 25 years old to book and stay at the property during entire reservation period<br>- No pets<br>- Just a quick heads-up: once you book we'll be using our nifty guest messaging platform for all our chit-chats, so keep an eye on your text for messages from our 850 phone number. Additionally, before the fun begins, we'll need you to sign our rental agreement that has a $100 authorization hold for incidentals. It's all part of the check-in charm! Thanks for being awesome!<br><br>Guest Access:<br>When you choose Circle Sea for your vacation, you gain exclusive access to the entire residence, ensuring a private and comfortable retreat for you and your guests.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
